            <head n="2" source="#source-40020-40122"><seg source="#source-40020-40026">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40026-40047"><rb>家内</rb><rt>かない</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40047-40050">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40050-40071"><rb>氷柱</rb><rt>つらゝ</rt></ruby></head>
          </div>
