        <div type="layout" source="#source-67674-77187" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
          <p source="#source-67709-67969"><seg source="#source-67709-67745">百樹曰、余丁酉の年の晩夏</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-67745-67769"><rb>豚児</rb><rt>せがれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-67769-67778">京水を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-67778-67799"><rb>従</rb><rt>したがへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-67799-67811">て北越に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-67811-67829"><rb>遊</rb><rt>あそび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-67829-67838">し時、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-67838-67871"><rb>三国嶺</rb><rt>みくにたふげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-67871-67874">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-67874-67889"><rb>踰</rb><rt>こえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-67889-67931">しは六月十五日なりしに、谷の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-67931-67946"><rb>底</rb><rt>そこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-67946-67969">に鶯をきゝて、</seg></p>
          <div type="layout" source="#source-67969-68118" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
            <p source="#source-67990-68118"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-67990-68005"><rb>足</rb><rt>あし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-68005-68056">もとに鶯を聞く我もまた谷わたりする</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-68062-68104"><seg source="#source-68056-68062">こし</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-68086-68089">越</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-68104-68118">の山ぶみ</seg></p>
