          <p source="#source-93420-98252"><seg source="#source-93420-93423">○</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93423-93438"><rb>茲</rb><rt>ここ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93438-93441">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93441-93453"><rb>吾</rb><rt>わ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93453-93456">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93456-93471"><rb>住</rb><rt>すむ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93471-93495"><rb>近在</rb><rt>きんざい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93495-93498">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93498-93525"><rb>后谷村</rb><rt>ごやむら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93525-93573">といふあり。此村の弥左ヱ門といふ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93573-93594"><rb>農夫</rb><rt>のうふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93594-93597">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93597-93612"><rb>老</rb><rt>おい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93612-93618">たる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93618-93642"><rb>双親</rb><rt>ふたおや</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93642-93666"><rb>年頃</rb><rt>としごろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93666-93726">のねがひにまかせ、秋のはじめ信州善光寺へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93726-93750"><rb>参詣</rb><rt>さんけい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93750-93828">させけり。さてある日用ありて二里ばかりの所へゆきたる</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93828-93846"><rb>留守</rb><rt>るす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93846-93849">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93849-93870"><rb>隣家</rb><rt>りんか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93870-93876">の者</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93876-93900"><rb>過</rb><rt>あやまち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93900-93909">て火を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-93909-93924"><rb>出</rb><rt>いだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-93924-93939">したちまち</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#sour