          <div>
            <head n="2" source="#source-220787-220880"><seg source="#source-220787-220793">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-220793-220832"><rb>北高和尚</rb><rt>ほくかうわせう</rt></ruby></head>
          </div>
