            <head n="2" source="#source-262432-262537"><seg source="#source-262432-262438">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-262438-262459"><rb>田代</rb><rt>たしろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-262459-262468">の七ツ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-262468-262483"><rb>釜</rb><rt>かま</rt></ruby></head>
