        <div type="layout" source="#source-274579-274688" style="padding-inline-start: 4em">
          <div>
            <head n="2" source="#source-274600-274684"><seg source="#source-274600-274606">○　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-274606-274639"><rb>火浣布</rb><rt>くわくわんふ</rt></ruby></head>
          </div>
